 ploads/event/Carlos%20Roberto%20Montoya%20%281%29_20260127005318264105.png
DESCRIPTION:On Wednesday\, January 7th\, an American citizen\, Renée Good
 \, was killed by Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) in Minneapolis\
 , Minnesota. This killing is part of a broader pattern of unchecked violen
 ce\, impunity\, and abuse carried out by federal immigration enforcement a
 gencies against members of our communities. On August 14\, 2025\, Roberto 
 Carlos Montoya died during an I.C.E raid in Monrovia\, California. He was 
 struck by a car and killed while being pursued by I.C.E. Almost immediatel
 y\, DH
LOCATION:Bicentennial Way & Mendocino Avenue\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95403
