  we phonebank into CA-22 and CA-07 to elect Working Families Party champio
 ns Randy Villegas and Mai Vang! We’ll be making calls every Wednesday an
 d Thursday evening through Primary Election Day on June 2nd\, talking dire
 ctly with voters about what’s at stake and why we need bold\, corporate 
 free working-class leadership in Congress. It’s critical that we do ever
 ything we can to help send these two champions to Washington DC. Sign up t
 od
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/ca-wfp/event/914582/
