DESCRIPTION:In this fast-moving weekly zoom\, we find our place of contrib
 ution in this fast-moving resistance movement. Each week\, we survey a wid
 e range of strategies\, leaders\, and organizations to learn how we can am
 plify our voices and contribute to midterm election victories. Along the w
 ay\, we feel a sense of connection and confidence in our voice. Rooted in 
 nonviolence and compassion\, we close each session with a call for greater
  compassion and hope. An online Resource List\, used in each meeting\, is 
 av
