 ploads/event/Can%28vass%29%20Mobilize%20pic_20250724201956361039.png
DESCRIPTION:**One voter and one conversation at a time ... that's how Demo
 crats win!** Studies have shown that turnout increases by up to 9 percenta
 ge points through door-to-door canvassing! Are you thinking about canvassi
 ng\, but don't feel quite ready? If you've never canvassed before\, or jus
 t need a refresher\, join the Bay Area Coalition Tuesdays\, 7 pm (PST) to 
 talk about what your canvassing day will look like\, including .......... 
 - How to have meaningful and deep canvassing conversations with voters - 
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/cadems/event/596490/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
